{"content_hash": "3d868a10cec80226", "version_id": 812, "article_id": 82, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "XPeng launches MONA L05 SUV, starting at 139,800 yuan", "title_zh": "小鹏MONA L05上市，13.98万元起", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1686761?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720774401213-08da3073d9e2?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fG1vbmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzMyMjkyNnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Richard Multimedia on Unsplash", "author": "Richard Multimedia", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rmultimedia?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-crowd-of-people-standing-in-front-of-a-painting-WW4M24Z_yw4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(286, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(324, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "22de88a019f8"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-30", "word_count": 151, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "XPeng has a new electric SUV. The MONA L05 is the third car in the MONA family. It is cheap, big inside, and ready to sell around the world.", "lead_zh": "小鹏推出了一款新的电动SUV。MONA L05是MONA系列的第三款车。它价格不高、空间大，还准备卖到全球。", "preview": "The car went on sale today. It comes in six versions. Prices start at 139,800 yuan, and buyers can get 5,000 yuan off before December 15, 20", "preview_zh": "这款车今天正式上市，共有六款配置。起售价13.98万元，2026年12月15日前下单可优惠5000元。小鹏提前生产了5000台车，买家可以很快提车。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 797, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 63.475, "size_bytes": 381744, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 177, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5e0dbb9/content/data/versions/812.json", "paragraphs": ["The car went on sale today. It comes in six versions. Prices start at 139,800 yuan, and buyers can get 5,000 yuan off before December 15, 2026. XPeng built 5,000 cars early, so buyers can get their car fast.", "The L05 is a big five-seat SUV. It has a 26.8-inch screen instead of a normal dashboard. The back seats are comfortable, and there is a lot of space for bags. The car can carry nine suitcases with five people inside.", "There are two kinds of power. The electric version can drive up to 635 km. The range-extender version can drive 1,310 km in total. XPeng says charging from 30% to 80% takes only 15.8 minutes.", "XPeng wants to sell the L05 in 82 countries. It plans to enter Europe in early 2027. The MONA family has already sold over 360,000 cars. XPeng also says most buyers choose the smart driving version."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这款车今天正式上市，共有六款配置。起售价13.98万元，2026年12月15日前下单可优惠5000元。小鹏提前生产了5000台车，买家可以很快提车。", "L05是一台大五座SUV。它没有传统仪表盘，改用一块26.8英寸的屏幕。后排座椅很舒服，放行李的地方也很多。五个人坐满时，还能装下九个行李箱。", "这款车有两种动力。纯电版最多能跑635公里。增程版综合续航达到1310公里。小鹏说，电量从30%充到80%只要15.8分钟。", "小鹏计划在82个国家销售L05，并打算2027年初进入欧洲市场。MONA系列已经卖出超过36万台。小鹏还表示，大多数买家选择了智驾版本。"], "body": "The car went on sale today. It comes in six versions. Prices start at 139,800 yuan, and buyers can get 5,000 yuan off before December 15, 2026. XPeng built 5,000 cars early, so buyers can get their car fast.\n\nThe L05 is a big five-seat SUV. It has a 26.8-inch screen instead of a normal dashboard. The back seats are comfortable, and there is a lot of space for bags. The car can carry nine suitcases with five people inside.\n\nThere are two kinds of power. The electric version can drive up to 635 km. The range-extender version can drive 1,310 km in total. XPeng says charging from 30% to 80% takes only 15.8 minutes.\n\nXPeng wants to sell the L05 in 82 countries. It plans to enter Europe in early 2027. The MONA family has already sold over 360,000 cars. XPeng also says most buyers choose the smart driving version.", "body_zh": "这款车今天正式上市，共有六款配置。起售价13.98万元，2026年12月15日前下单可优惠5000元。小鹏提前生产了5000台车，买家可以很快提车。\n\nL05是一台大五座SUV。它没有传统仪表盘，改用一块26.8英寸的屏幕。后排座椅很舒服，放行李的地方也很多。五个人坐满时，还能装下九个行李箱。\n\n这款车有两种动力。纯电版最多能跑635公里。增程版综合续航达到1310公里。小鹏说，电量从30%充到80%只要15.8分钟。\n\n小鹏计划在82个国家销售L05，并打算2027年初进入欧洲市场。MONA系列已经卖出超过36万台。小鹏还表示，大多数买家选择了智驾版本。", "text": "The car went on sale today. It comes in six versions. Prices start at 139,800 yuan, and buyers can get 5,000 yuan off before December 15, 2026. XPeng built 5,000 cars early, so buyers can get their car fast. The L05 is a big five-seat SUV. It has a 26.8-inch screen instead of a normal dashboard. The back seats are comfortable, and there is a lot of space for bags. The car can carry nine suitcases with five people inside. There are two kinds of power. The electric version can drive up to 635 km. The range-extender version can drive 1,310 km in total. XPeng says charging from 30% to 80% takes only 15.8 minutes. XPeng wants to sell the L05 in 82 countries. It plans to enter Europe in early 2027. The MONA family has already sold over 360,000 cars. XPeng also says most buyers choose the smart driving version.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "推出；上市", "note": "常用来说新产品发布", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "version", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本；配置", "note": "指同一车型的不同配置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "electric", "pos": "adj", "zh": "电动的", "note": "electric car 电动车", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "range", "pos": "noun", "zh": "续航里程", "note": "range-extender 指增程版", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "充电", "note": "charging 充电", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "comfortable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "舒适的", "note": "形容座椅、空间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "suitcase", "pos": "noun", "zh": "行李箱", "note": "复数 suitcases", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "smart driving", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "智能驾驶", "note": "指辅助驾驶功能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-30T01:15:22